#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h1>
#: template.html:14 template.html:26
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Battle for Wesnoth 1.20"
msgstr "Kampen om Wesnoth 1.6"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div>
#: template.html:24
msgid ""
"<a id=\"bigshield\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Wesnoth logo\"><span aria-"
"hidden=\"true\"></span></a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h1>
#: template.html:26
msgid "<span id=\"branding-sub\">Azure Expanses Update</span>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><p>
#: template.html:29
msgid ""
"<i>November 2026.</i> The development team is proud to present version 1.20 "
"of <cite><a href=\"/\">The&nbsp;Battle&nbsp;for&nbsp;Wesnoth</a></cite>!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><p>
#: template.html:31
msgid ""
"This release has a variety of major and minor changes to all parts of the "
"game from multiple new and revised campaigns, an overhauled UI, a variety of "
"new multiplayer features, improved graphical performance, new functionality "
"for content creators, a new Android port, and even more! Try out the new "
"features for yourself, or read on for more details..."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><a><span>
#: template.html:35
msgid ""
"<a class=\"download-button\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://www.wesnoth.org/"
"#download\"> <span class=\"download-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> "
"<span class=\"download-text\"> <span class=\"download-big\">Download Now</"
"span> </span> </a> <a class=\"itchio-button\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://"
"wesnoth.itch.io/battle-for-wesnoth\" aria-label=\"Available on itch.io\"> "
"<span class=\"download-text\">"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div>
#: template.html:45
msgid ""
"<span class=\"download-big\">Get on itch.io</span> </span> </a> <a "
"class=\"steam-button\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/"
"app/599390\"> <span class=\"download-text\"> <span class=\"steam-icon\" aria-"
"hidden=\"true\"></span> <span class=\"download-big\">Get on Steam</span> </"
"span> </a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h2>
#: template.html:62
#, fuzzy
msgid "What’s New in This Update"
msgstr "Vad är nytt i Wesnoth 1.6"

# type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><h3>
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h3>
#: template.html:64
msgid "For Players"
msgstr "För spelare"

# type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><div><div><a>
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><a>
#: template.html:65
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "<a href='images/start-4-full.jpg'>"
msgid "<a href=\"images/start-2.jpg\">"
msgstr "<a href='images/start-4-full.jpg'>"

#. type: Attribute 'alt' of: <html><body><div><div><div><a><img>
#: template.html:65
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Wesnoth Screenshot"
msgid "Celes theme screenshot"
msgstr "Skärmdump av Wesnoth"

# type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div>
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div>
#: template.html:65 template.html:72 template.html:80 template.html:88
#: template.html:106
msgid "</a>"
msgstr "</a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:67
msgid ""
"Wesnoth once again has an Android port, currently available on the <a "
"href=\"https://f-droid.org/en/packages/org.wesnoth.Wesnoth/\">F-Droid store</"
"a>, representing both a lot of work and the first time in many years that a "
"modern version of Wesnoth is available outside of the usual Windows, macOS, "
"and Linux systems. It is, however, still very much a work in progress and "
"due to UI constraints will work better on tablets than phones."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:69
msgid ""
"Performance has been further improved, with graphical lag and stuttering "
"significantly reduced especially on lower end systems."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:71
msgid ""
"Additionally, with this release the new Celes UI theme has been added "
"containing a major overhaul of the main menu to give Wesnoth a more "
"interesting and modern look. The in-game help browser now also has a search "
"and collapsible sidebar to help make it easier to find the information "
"you're looking for. The previous theme, dubbed \"Parchment\" still exists "
"and both can be switched via display preferences."
msgstr ""

